# dashboard/ — Datadog-style data dashboards

12-column grid + horizontal rail layouts for tournament stat pages. Uses **shadcn Card**
via `DashboardTile` with CVA size variants.

## Key files

- `DashboardTile.tsx` — tile shell (art + caption footer)
- `DashboardGrid.tsx` — `lg:grid-cols-12` placement
- `DashboardRail.tsx` — Home horizontal scroll (fixed deck-tile columns)
- `dashboardTileVariants.ts` — size tokens + chart sizing helpers

## Conventions

- **Tailwind** utilities allowed here (not BEM).
- Theme via `shadcn-theme.css` / Excelsior tokens — no hardcoded zinc palette.
- Layout configs live in `src/lib/tournaments/*DashboardLayout.ts`.
- Tile content builders: `buildColumbusStatsTiles.tsx` pattern.

See [`DashboardGrid.md`](DashboardGrid.md) and [`docs/current/SHADCN_UI.md`](../../../docs/current/SHADCN_UI.md).
